<title>UK: Reuters European companies survey by country.</title>
<headline>Reuters European companies survey by country.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are the top-rated analysts by country in the 1997 Reuters European larger companies survey carried out by Tempest Consultants Ltd.</p>
<p>The analysts were rated by fund managers.</p>
<p> Economic forecasting - Germany Goldman Sachs</p>
<p> Pan European strategy - Merrill Lynch</p>
<p> Austria - SBC Warburg		  Belgium/Lux - Dillon Read</p>
<p> Denmark - Alfred Berg		  Finland - Alfred Berg</p>
<p> France - Cheuvreux de Virieu-Indosuez</p>
<p> Germany - Deutsche Morgan Grenfell  Italy - Intermobiliare</p>
<p> Netherlands - ABN-AMRO Hoare Govett</p>
<p> Norway - Alfred Berg		   Spain - Merrill Lynch</p>
<p> Sweden - Alfred Berg		   Switzerland - Pictet &amp; Cie</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
